{"seq":9,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:38:17.553Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f84dda9b010907e37e01216c8d08085aeaed104291cd6ad6936b12d93a098a56","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's digests say. Most of them refer to accounts by owner (\"Gideon's fleet account\") instead of by name, so some of this is inferred.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It moved from Nadia Fennimore to Gideon on **2026-05-04**. The 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the reassignment. The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. He was already running it in the 2025 digests. The 5/4/2026 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day, which is ambiguous, so I'd treat it as Gideon without a firm change date.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, as best I can tell. The 9/30 digest lists the open Thanksgiving blackout item under \"Gideon's medical account\", right after the Orlavine entry. The March 2025 digest called it \"Nadia's medical account\", so it moved at some point. I found no digest that gives the date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it the pod's retail or outdoor account. Nadia hosted a training session for it, but that doesn't make her the owner. Please check the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nI only found digests through 9/30, so anything that changed after that wouldn't show up here."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
